<title>HUNGARY: TOP TEN HUNGARY BROKERAGES BY H1 '96 TURNOVER - BSE.</title>
<headline>TOP TEN HUNGARY BROKERAGES BY H1 '96 TURNOVER - BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange</p>
<p>published on Wednesday rankings for Hungarian brokerages by</p>
<p>turnover in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>List of top ten brokerages by H1 1996 turnover follows.</p>
<p> (MILLION FORINTS) Total turnover    Stocks     Govt securities</p>
<p>  1. Creditanstalt</p>
<p>   Ertekpapir	    264,080.2     45,327.6	 217,651.7</p>
<p>  2. New York Broker   180,272.5	3,494.1	 166,768.1</p>
<p>  3. Internationale</p>
<p>   Nederlanden</p>
<p>   Ertekpapir	    161,907.9     55,318.1	  87,359.2</p>
<p>  4. Takarek Broker    132,272.5	1,224.6	 130,968.8</p>
<p>  5. Postabank</p>
<p>   Ertekpapir	     73,589.1	4,214.2	  67,805.5</p>
<p>  6. ABN AMRO</p>
<p>   Hoare Govett	   73,387.2	7,579.7	  65,523.3</p>
<p>  7. MKB Ertekpapir     69,698.0	1,667.8	  67,586.5</p>
<p>  8. AB-Moneta	    69,489.9	1,595.8	  67,877.3</p>
<p>  9. Raiffeisen</p>
<p>   Ertekpapir	     67,333.3	3,784.6	  63,401.5</p>
<p> 10. K&amp;H Brokerhaz	51,139.5	1,455.1	  48,364.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Total turnover also includes corporate bonds,</p>
<p>investment fund units, compensation coupons and other</p>
<p>securities.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
